cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "protocell-genesis: a WebGPU primordial-soup simulation with pre-registered gates"
abstract: >-
  A coarse-grained soup of monomers on the GPU, with emergent hydrophobicity, catalyst-grown chain
  chemistry, explicit water, evaporation and constant-pH electrostatics, tested against pass criteria
  fixed before the runs. No closed vesicle formed: the aggregate percolates through a periodic box and,
  in a finite water parcel, stays compact and traps no water.
authors:
